old tracking-tight text-navy md:text-lg\">MIQ LLC</span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-1 md:flex\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/portfolio\">Portfolio</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-navy px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-navy-2\" href=\"/contact\">Get a Free Consultation</a></div><button class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg p-2 text-navy md:hidden\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><!--&--><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#webpage\",\"name\":\"Wikipedia Page Creation Service & Consulting | MIQ LLC\",\"description\":\"MIQ LLC (legal entity: MIQ Enterprises LLC) is an international digital services and technology solutions company delivering professional Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing and notability research, SEO, AEO, GEO, digital marketing, website development, branding, reputation management, and business technology solutions for clients in the United States and worldwide.\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What Wikipedia services does MIQ Enterprises provide?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"MIQ Enterprises LLC provides Wikipedia consulting services including Wikipedia notability assessment, citation and reliable source research, Wikipedia article writing guidance, neutral draft planning, Wikipedia editing support, Articles for Creation (AfC) process guidance, conflict-of-interest disclosure guidance, and Wikipedia page maintenance recommendations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are AEO and GEO?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) structures content so answer engines can extract clear, direct responses. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) improves entity clarity, topical authority, and trustworthy signals so generative AI systems can understand and cite content accurately. MIQ Enterprises applies both alongside strong SEO fundamentals.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does MIQ Enterprises guarantee Wikipedia publication or #1 rankings?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. MIQ Enterprises LLC does not guarantee Wikipedia publication, approval, retention, rankings, or AI citations. Wikipedia decisions are made by independent editors, and search/AI systems control their own results. We focus on ethical, research-driven, best-practice guidance.\"}}]}</script><section class=\"hero-grid overflow-hidden text-white\"><div class=\"grid-lines\"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 py-20 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] md:py-28\"><div><p class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/8 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-200\">International Digital Services &amp; Technology Solutions</p><h1 class=\"mt-5 font-display max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">Wikipedia Page Creation Service, Consulting &amp; Digital Growth</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/78\">MIQ LLC is a worldwide Wikipedia page creation service and consulting company. We help eligible clients with Wikipedia notability assessment, independent source research, neutral article drafting guidance, Wikipedia editing support, and responsible page maintenance in the United States and worldwide.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-slate-100\" href=\"/contact\">Get a Free Consultation</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/services\">Explore Our Services</a></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-white/60\">Your Vision. Our Digital Expertise.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/8 p-6 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-sky-200\">Digital Growth Framework</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column lucide-bar-chart-3 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-navy/35 p-4\"><div class=\"font-display font-semibold\">Credibility</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-white/68\">Wikipedia consulting, reputation, brand trust</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-navy/35 p-4\"><div class=\"font-display font-semibold\">Visibility</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-white/68\">SEO, content, AI search, digital marketing</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-navy/35 p-4\"><div class=\"font-display font-semibold\">Conversion</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-white/68\">Web development, lead capture, user experience</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-navy/35 p-4\"><div class=\"font-display font-semibold\">Scale</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-white/68\">Automation, AI integration, technology consulting</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad \"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-start\"><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Company Introduction</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">International digital solutions with a premium standard</h2></div><div class=\"text-lg leading-8 text-muted\"><p>MIQ LLC is an international digital solutions company committed to helping businesses establish credibility, improve online visibility, and grow through innovative digital services.</p><p class=\"mt-4\">We work with entrepreneurs, business owners, executives, organizations, startups, and established companies seeking a professional partner for strategy, design, marketing, and technology execution.</p></div></div><div class=\"container-tight mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Trustworthy delivery</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Professional communication, clear scope, and responsible service practices.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-earth lucide-globe-2 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54\"></path><path d=\"M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17\"></path><path d=\"M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">International approach</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Digital solutions designed for US and worldwide audiences.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles lucide-stars text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Premium execution</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Modern design, strategic thinking, and technology-driven implementation.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"section-pad bg-surface\"><div class=\"container-tight \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\"><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Our Services</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Specialized services for modern business growth</h2></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-navy\" href=\"/services\">View all services <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-electric/30 hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/services/wikipedia-services\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" view