2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">SEO &amp; Digital Marketing</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Data-informed SEO, AEO, GEO, and digital marketing strategies designed to improve visibility in traditional search, answer engines, and generative AI experiences.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore service <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-electric/30 hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/services/website-development\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-earth lucide-globe-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54\"></path><path d=\"M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17\"></path><path d=\"M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Website Development</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Modern, responsive, and performance-focused websites designed to communicate trust and convert visitors into inquiries.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore service <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-electric/30 hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/services/online-reputation-management\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Online Reputation Management</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Strategic reputation and visibility support to help individuals and businesses present a credible, professional online presence.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore service <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-electric/30 hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/services/branding-creative-solutions\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles lucide-stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Branding &amp; Creative Solutions</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Premium branding and creative assets that help businesses communicate clearly and present a consistent professional identity.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore service <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-electric/30 hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/services/business-technology-solutions\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Business &amp; Technology Solutions</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Practical technology and consulting solutions that help businesses streamline processes, generate leads, and adopt modern tools.</p><span class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore service <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad \"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.95fr_1.05fr]\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-navy p-8 text-white md:p-10\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\"><span class=\"text-gold\">Why MIQ Enterprises</span></p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">A premium partner for credibility and digital performance</h2><ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75\"><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Client-focused strategy.</strong> Services are aligned with your goals, audience, and practical constraints.</li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Responsible consulting.</strong> We communicate clearly, especially for policy-sensitive services such as Wikipedia consulting.</li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Modern execution.</strong> We combine design, SEO, technology, and conversion thinking into cohesive solutions.</li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Global mindset.</strong> Serving clients across the United States and worldwide with a professional digital-first approach.</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Free Consultation</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Request a quote or consultation</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted\">Share your goals and we’ll help identify the right service path.</p><div class=\"mt-6\"><form class=\"grid gap-4\"><input type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"companyWebsite\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"service\" value=\"\"/><div class=\"grid gap-4 \"><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Full name<input required=\"\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"Your name\" name=\"name\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Email<input required=\"\" type=\"email\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" name=\"email\"/></label></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 \"><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Phone / WhatsApp (optional)<input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"+1...\" name=\"phone\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Inquiry type<select name=\"inquiryType\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\"><option selected=\"\">Free Consultation</option><option>Service Inquiry</option><option>Request a Quote</option><option>General Question</option></select></label></div><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Message<textarea required=\"\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your goals, timeline, and the services you need.\"></textarea></label><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-navy-2 disabled:opacity-60\">Submit Inquiry</button><p class=\"text-xs text-muted\">By submitting, you agree to be contacted regarding your inquiry. We use form validation and spam protection; please provide accurate information.</p></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad \"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr]\"><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Common questions about Wikipedia consulting, AEO &amp; GEO</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted\">Direct answers to common questions about our Wikipedia services and modern search visibility approach.</p></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white\"><details class=\"group\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">What Wikipedia services does MIQ Enterprises provide?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">MIQ Enterprises LLC provides Wikipedia consulting services including Wikipedia notability assessment, citation and reliable source research, Wikipedia article writing guidance, neutral draft planning, Wikipedia editing support, Articles for Creation (AfC) process guidance, conflict-of-interest disclosure guidance, and Wikipedia page maintenance recommendations.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">What are AEO and GEO?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) structures content so answer engines can extract clear, direct responses. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) improves entity clarity, topical authority, and trustworthy signals so generative AI systems can understand and cite content accurately. MIQ Enterprises applies both alongside strong SEO fundamentals.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Does MIQ Enterprises guarantee Wikipedia publication or #1 rankings?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">No. MIQ Enterprises LLC does not guarantee Wikipedia publication, approval, retention, rankings, or AI citations. Wikipedia decisions are made by independent editors, and search/AI systems control their own results. We focus on ethical, research-driven, best-practice guidance.</div></details></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad bg-navy text-white\"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-center\"><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\"><span class=\"text-gold\">Insights</span></p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold\">Subscribe for practical digital insights</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-white/72\">Receive updates when MIQ Enterprises publishes resources on Wikipedia consulting, AEO, GEO, visibility, and technology.</p></div><div><form class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><input type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"companyWebsite\"/><label class=\"sr-only\" for=\"newsletter-email\">Email</label><input id=\"newsletter-email\" required=\"\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email address\" class=\"w-full rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-white/45\" name=\"email\"/><button class=\"rounded-full bg-gold px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:brightness-105 disabled:opacity-60\">Subscribe</button></form></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/&--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-navy text-white\"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=