Question\",\"name\":\"What are AEO and GEO?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) structures content so answer engines can extract clear, direct responses. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) improves entity clarity, topical authority, and trustworthy signals so generative AI systems can understand and cite content accurately. MIQ Enterprises applies both alongside strong SEO fundamentals.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does MIQ Enterprises guarantee Wikipedia publication or #1 rankings?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. MIQ Enterprises LLC does not guarantee Wikipedia publication, approval, retention, rankings, or AI citations. Wikipedia decisions are made by independent editors, and search/AI systems control their own results. We focus on ethical, research-driven, best-practice guidance.\"}}]}f:X\nf:C\n10:X\n10:300\n10:C\n1:[[\"children\",{\"s\":\"__PAGE__\",\"h\":49282,\"d\":{\"r\":[\"$\",\"$2\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#webpage\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Wikipedia Page Creation Service & Consulting | MIQ LLC\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"MIQ LLC (legal entity: MIQ Enterprises LLC) is an international digital services and technology solutions company delivering professional Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing and notability research, SEO, AEO, GEO, digital marketing, website development, branding, reputation management, and business technology solutions for clients in the United States and worldwide.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\\\"},\\\"about\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\\\"},\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",